====== D-Link DAP-2695 ======

The D-Link DAP-2695 is a wireless AC dualband gigabit access point with [[wp>Power over Ethernet|PoE]].

OEM source code available at: [[http://tsd.dlink.com.tw/downloads2008detail.asp]]

